Third-party software shipped with the Guildwise workstation runner
=====================================================================

The runner's project graph indexer (docs/design/project-graphs.md) parses source code with tree-sitter, in its WebAssembly
build. The files below ship in the runner package under `dist/grammars/`. All of them are MIT licensed; the copyright and
licence text each of them asks to be kept follows.

Shipped files and their origin
------------------------------

  dist/grammars/tree-sitter.cjs, tree-sitter.wasm
      tree-sitter (the incremental parsing library), WebAssembly build.
      Obtained through the npm package @vscode/tree-sitter-wasm 0.3.1 (MIT, Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation),
      which packages tree-sitter 0.25 for the browser and Node.
  dist/grammars/tree-sitter-typescript.wasm, tree-sitter-tsx.wasm
      tree-sitter-typescript.
  dist/grammars/tree-sitter-javascript.wasm
      tree-sitter-javascript.
  dist/grammars/tree-sitter-python.wasm
      tree-sitter-python.
  dist/grammars/tree-sitter-go.wasm
      tree-sitter-go.
  dist/grammars/tree-sitter-c-sharp.wasm
      tree-sitter-c-sharp.

